    "caption": "🇦🇪 Astana Hub hosted a meetup focused on the UAE market and opportunities within the DIFC ecosystem.\n\nParticipants explored how startups and tech companies from Kazakhstan and Central Asia can enter and scale in the UAE market, guided by insights from Steve Gotz, Head of Business at DIFC Innovation Hub.\n\nThe discussion covered key UAE market trends, DIFC’s role in driving fintech and innovation across the MENA region, the types of startups currently in demand, and the support available through DIFC Innovation Hub.\n\n👉 Visit the “Events” section at astanahub.com to discover upcoming meetups and international opportunities.",
